title Cassette bound (CASSETTE_DEMO=1): two takes recorded; in the list MERGE (key M) chooses the highlighted take (Take 002) first, Down and Enter choose Take 001 second, M opens the merge box with the new take's name (take 003), KEEP ORIGINALS merges: the notice names Take 003, the new take is highlighted, the originals stay
sizes 480x320 320x480
ppmm 608
env CASSETTE_DEMO 1
env CASSETTE_DEMO_HOME demo-home
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 1500
expect text "SOFT"
tap "REC"
wait 2300
tap "STOP"
wait 1000
tap "REC"
wait 2300
tap "STOP"
wait 1000
key l
wait 700
expect text "Take 002"
expect text "Take 001"
expect text "MERGE"
key m
wait 500
expect text "CANCEL"
expect notext "RENAME"
key down
wait 200
key enter
wait 300
key m
wait 1000
expect text "Merge 2 takes?"
expect text "KEEP ORIGINALS"
shot merge-box
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
key enter
wait 3000
expect text "Merged 2 takes into Take 003"
expect text "Take 003"
expect text "Take 002"
expect text "RENAME"
shot merged
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
key esc
wait 500
expect text "SOFT"
expect noquit
